    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Maths was a strong subject in my school days—I loved the structure and problem-solving it offered. As an adult, though, I find it more analytical than creative, which suits my disciplined side (high conscientiousness) but sometimes feels distant from real-world applications.",
