    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs could personalize explanations (like a tutoring assistant) for abstract concepts—my high conscientiousness thrives on precision, so tailored steps would help. Interactive exercises with instant feedback could boost engagement more than lectures; even my low extraversion might find collaborative AI partners motivating."
